  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200C.",
    "Combine sultanas, shio‑koji, olive oil, grated ginger, and a pinch of sea salt in a bowl and toss until coated.",
    "Spread the coated sultanas in a single layer on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast for 10 to 12 minutes until caramelized and slightly puffed.",
    "While the sultanas roast, toss mixed salad greens with lime juice, chopped mint, and chopped cilantro.",
    "When the sultanas are done, let them cool slightly and then sprinkle them over the greens.",
    "Top the salad with roasted cashews, toasted sesame seeds, and a drizzle of extra olive oil.",
    "Serve immediately for a fresh crunch or chill for 15 minutes for a refreshing contrast."
  ],
